# Sketch accuracy test material (real sketches, true sizes, results) stays on the computer that runs the test
sketch-eval/*
!sketch-eval/README.md
!sketch-eval/example.json

# Photo accuracy test material (real photos, what is in them, results) stays on the computer that runs the test
photo-eval/*
!photo-eval/README.md
!photo-eval/example.json

# Your own damp and mould test photos and results stay on your computer
hazard-eval/*
!hazard-eval/README.md

# Your own meter and label test photos and results stay on your computer
reading-eval/*
!reading-eval/README.md
